## 7. API Design

### 7.1 Authentication Endpoints

```
POST /api/auth/register
- Body: { username, email, password }
- Response: { user, token }

POST /api/auth/login
- Body: { email, password }
- Response: { user, token }

POST /api/auth/logout
- Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
- Response: { message }

GET /api/auth/me
- Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
- Response: { user }
```

### 7.2 Mood Tracking Endpoints

```
POST /api/mood
- Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
- Body: { moodScore, notes?, tags?, timeOfDay }
- Response: { moodEntry }

GET /api/mood
- Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
- Query: ?startDate=YYYY-MM-DD&endDate=YYYY-MM-DD&limit=30
- Response: { moodEntries, stats }

GET /api/mood/trends
- Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
- Query: ?period=week|month|year
- Response: { trends, insights }

PUT /api/mood/:id
- Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
- Body: { moodScore?, notes?, tags? }
- Response: { moodEntry }

DELETE /api/mood/:id
- Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
- Response: { message }
```

### 7.3 Activities Endpoints

```
GET /api/activities
- Query: ?category=breathing&difficulty=beginner
- Response: { activities }

GET /api/activities/recommendations
- Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
- Response: { recommendedActivities }

POST /api/activities/:id/complete
- Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
- Body: { rating?, notes?, duration? }
- Response: { userActivity, pointsEarned }

GET /api/activities/history
- Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
- Query: ?limit=20&page=1
- Response: { userActivities, pagination }
```

### 7.4 Community Endpoints

```
GET /api/community/posts
- Query: ?category=support&page=1&limit=10
- Response: { posts, pagination }

POST /api/community/posts
- Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
- Body: { title, content, category, tags }
- Response: { post }

GET /api/community/posts/:id
- Response: { post, comments }

POST /api/community/posts/:id/like
- Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
- Response: { likes }

POST /api/community/posts/:id/comments
- Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
- Body: { content }
- Response: { comment }
```

### 7.5 User Profile Endpoints

```
GET /api/users/profile
- Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
- Response: { profile, stats }

PUT /api/users/profile
- Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
- Body: { displayName?, preferences? }
- Response: { profile }

GET /api/users/stats
- Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
- Response: { stats, achievements }
```

